    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nPlease enquire by email only regarding this property.\n\nSherry FitzGerald O'Donovan is delighted to present this beautifully maintained five-bedroom detached home to the rental market. Ideally located within walking distance to Midleton town centre, this exceptional home offers spacious accommodation and picturesque surroundings while remaining within easy reach of Midleton.\n\nAccommodation comprises two generous reception rooms, a bright and spacious kitchen/dining area, a separate utility room providing additional storage, five well-proportioned bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, and a modern family bathroom.\n\nSet on approximately 0.37 acres of beautifully landscaped gardens, the property enjoys a tranquil while still being within walking distance to Midleton and its excellent range of amenities, including shops, schools, restaurants, and transport links.\n\nApplications for this property are welcomed via HomeHak. Prospective tenants are encouraged to submit their Tenant CV through the HomeHak platform as part of the application process."
      },
